Here’s what the file does and the excerpts you asked for.

## 1. Submit function and API

The handler is **`submit`** (wired with `@click="submit"` on the primary button). It is **not** named `handleSubmit`.

It builds a `payload` and calls **`createUniversalClassSchedule(payload)`** from `frontend/src/lib/universalSchedulerApi.js`, which sends:

- **`POST /api/v1/class-sessions/batch`**
- JSON body, `Authorization: Bearer <token>`

Relevant part of `submit` (validation → payload → API call):

```918:1100:/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue
async function submit() {
  const branchId = Number(props.branchId || 0);
  if (branchId <= 0) {
    alert('請先選擇分校後再建立課程');
    return;
  }
  const todayYmd = getCurrentTodayYmd();
  if (!form.student_id) {
    alert('請選擇學生');
    return;
  }
  if (!form.teacher_id) {
    alert('請選擇老師');
    return;
  }
  const selectedTeacher = (props.teachers || []).find((teacher) => String(teacher.id) === String(form.teacher_id || ''));
  if (selectedTeacher) {
    const branchIds = Array.isArray(selectedTeacher.branch_ids)
      ? selectedTeacher.branch_ids.map((id) => Number(id)).filter((id) => Number.isFinite(id) && id > 0)
      : [];
    const teacherBranch = Number(selectedTeacher.branch_id || 0);
    if (branchIds.length > 0 && !branchIds.includes(branchId) && teacherBranch !== branchId) {
      alert('所選老師未綁定目前分校，請改選其他老師');
      return;
    }
  }
  // ... more validation and sessionPlan building ...
  submitting.value = true;
  try {
    // ... normalizedDaySlots ...
    const payload = {
      branch_id: branchId,
      student_id: Number(form.student_id),
      teacher_id: Number(form.teacher_id),
      subject: form.subject,
      class_type: form.class_type,
      // ...
      mode: props.mode,
    };

    if (form.payment_type === 'session') {
      payload.total_classes = safePlannedSessions.value;
    }

    const result = await createUniversalClassSchedule(payload);
    // ... alert + emit('success', result) ...
  } catch (err) {
    alert(err?.message || '排課失敗，請稍後再試');
  } finally {
    submitting.value = false;
  }
}
```

The API wrapper:

```20:39:/home/admin/frontend/src/lib/universalSchedulerApi.js
export async function createUniversalClassSchedule(payload) {
  const normalizedPayload = {
    ...payload,
    confirmed_dates: Array.isArray(payload?.confirmed_dates) ? payload.confirmed_dates : [],
    future_dates: Array.isArray(payload?.future_dates) ? payload.future_dates : [],
  };

  const token = await getAccessToken();
  if (!token) throw new Error('登入已過期，請重新登入');

  const res = await fetch('/api/v1/class-sessions/batch', {
    method: 'POST',
    credentials: 'include',
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
      Accept: 'application/json',
      Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`,
    },
    body: JSON.stringify(normalizedPayload),
  });
```

Note: **`total_classes` is only set on the payload when `payment_type === 'session'`**, and it uses `safePlannedSessions.value`, not the raw input field alone.

## 2. Template fields: subject, teacher, class_type, total_classes

```16:73:/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>學生 *</label>
                <SearchableSelect
                  v-model="form.student_id"
                  :options="studentOptions"
                  placeholder="輸入學生姓名搜尋..."
                />
              </div>

              <div class="form-group">
                <label>老師 *</label>
                <SearchableSelect
                  v-model="form.teacher_id"
                  :options="teacherOptions"
                  placeholder="輸入老師姓名搜尋..."
                />
              </div>

              <div class="form-group">
                <label>預設科目 *</label>
                <select v-model="form.subject">
                  <option v-for="s in subjectOptions" :key="s.value" :value="s.value">{{ s.label }}</option>
                </select>
                <p class="field-note">新增星期／新增時段時的預設科目；下方各時段可改為不同科目（會建立多筆學生課程）。</p>
              </div>
              // ...
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>上課類型 *</label>
                <select v-model="form.class_type">
                  <option value="one_on_one">一對一</option>
                  <option value="one_on_two">一對二</option>
                  <option value="one_on_three">一對三</option>
                  <option value="tutoring">輔導</option>
                  <option value="trial">試聽</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              // ...
              <div v-if="form.payment_type === 'session'" class="form-group">
                <label>購買總堂數 *</label>
                <input v-model.number="form.total_classes" type="number" min="1" />
              </div>
```

- **Teacher**: `form.teacher_id` via `SearchableSelect`.
- **Subject**: `form.subject` (label “預設科目”).
- **class_type**: `form.class_type` (“上課類型”).
- **total_classes**: `form.total_classes` input only when **`form.payment_type === 'session'`** (“購買總堂數”); for monthly billing, that block is replaced by settlement day / monthly sessions (see lines 75–91 in the full file).

## 3. Tab / mode UI at the top

**No.** The top of the modal is only a **`scheduler-header`** with `title` and a **subtitle** (`<h3>` + `<p class="scheduler-subtitle">`). There is no tab strip or mode toggle in that header. The component does expose a **`mode` prop** (used in the payload as `mode: props.mode`), but that is not rendered as top-level tab UI in this template.

